?- transform(~(~a), X).
X = a
?- transform(a => b, X).
X = ~a v b
?- transform(~(a & b), X).
X = ~a v ~b
?- transform(a & b v c, X).
X = (a v c)&(b v c)
?- retractall(clause(_)), translate(~(a => b) v c), findall(C, clause(C), L).
C = A
L = [a v c,~b v c]
